- Bugfix: harden menu callbacks and application reload lifecycles
- Bugfix: make Places/Apps switch button size consistent with sidebar icon size in horizontal mode
- Bugfix: make sidebar width equal to search bar width in horizontal mode
- Security: handle launcher paths and malformed search actions safely
- Search: make fuzzy matching Unicode-aware
- Release: align package metadata and installation examples with 0.7.2
- Properties: add "grid transparency" option for grid layout in result box
- Properties: add GTK theme/rounded shape option for the Apps/Places switch
- Presets: make the new "GTK theme" and "grid transparency" default option for Modern and FullScreen presets

